    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/2af51577ba09243e5717af8104e810c0.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/a48a1fd5be8dc0b11e948870dae2e2ba.poster.avif?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/a48a1fd5be8dc0b11e948870dae2e2ba.webm?t=1749303388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/a48a1fd5be8dc0b11e948870dae2e2ba.mp4?t=1749303388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through a\u00a0dense forest, solving puzzles based on loading parts of the game. Special loading torches and you \u2014 the player character \u2014 help keep the world stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/5c0dc4fce37c3a60adae0a5babf8cecc.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/04f64cf72e1212dcbceb0ba08bb858a2.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/d952cc309d299c9632102a18e31a9494.avif?t=1749303388\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the <strong>Northuldra</strong> inhabitants. When the world suddenly shuts down, having been dropped from the device's memory, they cannot move. Therefore, they will need your help.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/5c0dc4fce37c3a60adae0a5babf8cecc.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/cc2c63ea1bc86920a0d7333c9d502ca2.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is non-linear: each solved puzzle opens up new parts of the game to explore. Navigate through the world's unloaded tiles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/2af51577ba09243e5717af8104e810c0.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/a48a1fd5be8dc0b11e948870dae2e2ba.poster.avif?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/a48a1fd5be8dc0b11e948870dae2e2ba.webm?t=1749303388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/a48a1fd5be8dc0b11e948870dae2e2ba.mp4?t=1749303388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through a\u00a0dense forest, solving puzzles based on loading parts of the game. Special loading torches and you \u2014 the player character \u2014 help keep the world stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/5c0dc4fce37c3a60adae0a5babf8cecc.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/04f64cf72e1212dcbceb0ba08bb858a2.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/d952cc309d299c9632102a18e31a9494.avif?t=1749303388\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the <strong>Northuldra</strong> inhabitants. When the world suddenly shuts down, having been dropped from the device's memory, they cannot move. Therefore, they will need your help.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/5c0dc4fce37c3a60adae0a5babf8cecc.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/cc2c63ea1bc86920a0d7333c9d502ca2.webp?t=1749303388\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is non-linear: each solved puzzle opens up new parts of the game to explore. Navigate through the world's unloaded tiles.</p>",
    "short_description": "Mirkwood is a narrative-driven puzzle adventure set in a world fully aware of its digital existence. Use world-loading mechanics to solve puzzles and navigate the broken world.",
